%% Phase4 / timeline / G-11a 未缓存定位与双向分页
%% Helix owners: query/local_first.rs; timeline_navigation.rs; port_reply/dispatch_read.rs; event/timeline.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: queryMessages(locate uncached postId)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_locate_message", {postId,req_id})
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(locate)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_locate_message", payload)
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_locate_message", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist Scan local index
  Host->>DB: lookup postId
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(miss)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(miss)
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http GET locate context
  Host->>Go: HTTP locate/post context
  Go-->>Host: located row + older/newer page tokens
  Host->>E: PortReply(remote locate)
  E->>IM: continue locate correlation
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(located rows + cursor)
  Host->>DB: durable write located context
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet located window
  Host->>DB: readback anchor and tokens
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:located(postId,anchor,tokens)
  Sink-->>UI: resolve locate waiter；consumer scrolls to anchor
  Sink-->>FFI: batch raw located event
  Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw located event

  par independent older page
    UI->>Gate: im_load_older_context(current token)
    Gate->>Native: Tick::Command(older)
    Native->>E: route older
    E->>IM: HTTP/scan → PersistAtomic → readback
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:update(direction=older)
  and independent newer page
    UI->>Gate: im_load_newer_context(current token)
    Gate->>Native: Tick::Command(newer)
    Native->>E: route newer
    E->>IM: HTTP/scan → PersistAtomic → readback
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:update(direction=newer)
  end
  alt stale token / out-of-order page
    IM->>IM: reject stale page；do not merge older/newer responses
  end
  Note over UI,Web: 两个方向共享 durable anchor 但不共享 renderer reducer；当前 tests 的 im:read:result 与 production timeline event 命名存在 drift。
